NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the
connectome datasets, which are the work of others and carry their own terms:

  MaleCNS v1.0 — HHMI Janelia, Cambridge Drosophila Connectomics Group,
  Google Research and collaborators. CC-BY.
  https://male-cns.janelia.org/download/

  FlyWire / FAFB whole-brain connectome (snapshot 783) — CC-BY.
  Dorkenwald et al., Nature 2024; Schlegel et al., Nature 2024.
  https://zenodo.org/records/10676866

Derived files under data/processed/ are computed from those datasets and
inherit their CC-BY terms, which require attribution to the original authors.
